{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 141, "text": "对聂荣臻关千\n“固定\n区域的割据，用波浪式的推进\n政策\n＂的解释\n口）的批语\n（一九五0 年四月二十八日）\n同意。\n毛\n泽\n东\n四月二十八日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 ]\n中共中央驻印度支那共产党中央联络代表罗贵波一九五0\n年四月十五日致电中央军委，请求解释毛泽东关于\n“ 固定区域的割\n据，用波浪式的推进政策\n” 建立和发展根据地的思想。\n中央军委代\n理总参谋长聂荣臻四月二十八日起草了答复罗贵波的电报并送毛泽\n东审阅，毛泽东批复同意。\n这个电报的全文是：\n贵波同志：\n所问\n“ 固定区域的割据，用波浪式的推进政策\n” 的解释，答复\n如下：主席的这一军事原则是在民族民主革命战争中，敌强我弱的\n1 12 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "1e2511a88639fdff931b284dfc8f30ffd9698e21ef47a87124f312b0e30ce17f", "text_chars": 307}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 142, "text": "情况下，创建革命的根据地，巩固根据地，再依托根据地，扩大发\n展根据地，既反对保守主义，又反对冒进政策，使巩固根据地与发\n展根据地相结合的原则。所谓波浪式的推进，就是根据地扩展到某\n一境地，就要暂时停止推进，而进行新区的发动群众建立政权，建\n立人民武装等项巩固工作，到新区已经可以作为依托再行推进。请\n参看《毛选》井冈山前委对中央的报告。\n聂\n四月二十八日\n1 1 3 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "5bab42a3cbcc2684cc67306a54f28498666712b9324930e22ee89a30a85ea63f", "text_chars": 185}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 143, "text": "对中国新民主主义青年团\n团旗图案的批语\n(1)\n（一九五0 年四月二十八日）\n同意此式。\n毛\n泽\n东\n四月二十八日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 ] 这个批语写在中国新民主主义青年团中央送审的团旗图案\n下面。刘少奇批示：“这个好。“ 周恩来批示：“ 同意这个，但须将金\n黄色圆圈及五角星移放下点，置于红旗四分之一的中间。”\n1 14 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "5c9f4f01b728ec75b8172e06e54abce2cf33131f0aa9665c2292e6342cf4c62d", "text_chars": 169}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 144, "text": "少奇同志：\n关千修改在庆祝五一\n劳动节大会上的演说稿\n给刘少奇的信\n（一九五0 年四月二十九日）\n报告C 1 ] 略有些修改，\n已送恩来阅后还你。\n陈云C 2 ] 在请假\n中不看文件，没有送他看。\n修改的主要点如下：\n不要说\n“ 今年是困难的最后一年\n“ ,\n因今后几年内都会有困难，而且仍将是相当严重的困难，不过\n•\n•\n•\n•\n• \n将一年一年地减少罢了。其他说到困难\n” 很快就可以过去\n” 的\n话都删掉了。举东北为例一段合并到前面一段中去。\n国际形势一段说得策略一些。解释富农策略一段觉累赘，\n留待将来去说。纠正命令主义一段说得全面一些，并且不要太\n突出地去说财经干部。\n口号加了一旬C 3 J \n如时间来得及，请于你讲后即刻付排，送清样给我再看一\n•\n•\n•\n•\n•\n•\n•\n \n次，然后发表。\n． \n毛\n泽\n东\n四月二十九日上午五时\n根据手稿刊印。\n1 1 5 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "ccf99a7d3f1b3aa25ca0b07e48d45f522e9407075f2244261c7ba12d98b63482", "text_chars": 388}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 145, "text": "注\n释\nC 1 J 报告，指刘少奇一九五0年四月二十九日下午在全国政协\n召集的庆祝五一国际劳动节干部大会上的演说稿。这个演说五月一\n日在《人民日报》发表。\nC 2 J 陈云，\n当时任中共中央书记处候补书记、政务院副总理兼\n政务院财政经济委员会主任\n．\n0\nC 3 J 毛泽东所加的口号是：\n“全中国各民族各民主阶级各民主\n党派各人民团体的团结合作万岁！\n”\n1 16 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "aa65f00843aa7a717f5346e469dd8ce865102bbf860a07fa9f3a336a938cb521", "text_chars": 185}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 146, "text": "关千公布施行《中华人民\n共和国婚姻法〉的命令\n（一九五0 年四月三十日）\n中央人民政府委员会第七次会议通过的《中华人民共和国\n婚姻法》，应自一九五0 年五月一日起公布施行。\n自公布之日\n起，所有以前各解放区颁布的有关婚姻问题的一切暂行的条例\n和法令均予废止。\n此令\n主席\n毛泽东\n一九五0年四月三十日\n根据一九五0年五月－H\n《人民日报》刊印。\n1 1 7 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "b4628a0c0ca30280984bb2cf1049cd67c920b968d2e3d75626f615397dace4e4", "text_chars": 180}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 147, "text": "转发邓子恢关千起萃\n上改条例的意见的电报\n（一九五0 年四月三十日）\n饶漱石C 1 ] 同志：\n兹将邓子恢同志四月二十五日电C 2 ] 转发给你，作为你们\n起草土改法令的参考，你的意见如何盼告。\n毛\n泽\n东\n四月三十日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\n( 1  J 饶漱石，\n当时任中共中央华东局第一书记、华东军政委员\n会主席。\n( 2  J 四月二十五日电，指中共中央中南局第三书记、\n中南军政\n委员会副主席邓子恢一九五0年四月二十五日关于起草土改条例的\n意见给毛泽东的电报。\n电报着重申述了主张动富农出租土地的五条\n理由，指出：（一）江南各省土地占有情况，\n巳不像大革命以前那样\n集中，如湘、鄂、赣三省地、富及公堂土地，不及总土地的百分之\n五十，地、富出租地不及百分之四十。特别是老苏区及其周围土地\n更加分散，地主、富农土地只占三分之一左右。（二）如富农的出租\n1 18 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "c01a7c41e0dbe8f506ea50bf511eb3f4246eae308ed3dc803bd757e6df079fdd", "text_chars": 385}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 148, "text": "土地不动，则雇农、贫农所得比之桉人口平分标准要少百分之二十\n以上，湖北调查要少百分之三十。同时由于划阶级界限难明，估计\n许多中小地主会混到富农、\n中农中来，更缩小了没收土地的范围。\n（三）如可分土地太少，不能解决雇农、贫农的土地要求，会使雇\n农、贫农积极性减低，有些地方甚至土改运动搞不起来，使土改成\n为形式，这不仅在政治上不利，将来在生产上也有极大不利。\n因为\n在中国这样靠人工经营、人工肥料、人工灌溉的具体条件下，如果\n占人口大多数而富有劳动力的雇农、贫农，耕地不多，积极性不高，\n则农业生产的发展是要受到很大限制的。（四）使富农中立，单从不\n动其出租土地一点上照顾很难达到，除经济上适当照顾外，还应加\n上政治条件，如雇农、贫农的充分发动和中农的紧密团结，对恶霸\n地主的适当惩办等。\n（五）对富农出租地现在不动，过一二年再动，\n必须重分，则将影响生产，\n中农也会产生\n“ 割韭菜\n” 的疑惑。毛泽\n东阅后，除批示饶漱石外，还批写：\n“刘、周阅后发。\n”\n“ 此电发后退\n毛\n”\n“ 转发华东局、西南局、华北局、西北局。\n” 刘，指刘少奇。\n周，指周恩来。\n1 1 9 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "8858e5abef0731606052d474539a490ff89a0682b5c01bb6ec8579fb6db834b6", "text_chars": 487}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 149, "text": "关千暂时不动富农\n出租土地问题给邓子恢的电报\n（一九五0 年五月一日）\n子恢( 1 ] 同志，并告漱石( 2 J \n四月二十五日电( 3 ] 悉。\n（一）鉴于富农出租地数量不大，\n暂时不动这点土地影响贫雇农所得土地的数量也不会大，现在\n我的意见仍以为暂时不动较为适宜。\n（二）但你们可根据你们\n自己的各项意见起草一个土改法令草案，\n由子恢同志于五月十\n五日以后中央开会时带来（子恢同志动身日期另外通知），在\n中央会议上作最后的讨论和决定。\n（三）如华东局是赞成暂时\n不动富农出租土地的，则请华东局起草一个和华中( 4 ] 不相同\n的土改法令草案，\n以便在中央会议上对照讨论。\n毛\n泽\n东\n五月一日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 子恢，即邓子恢，\n当时任中共中央中南局第三书记、中南\n军政委员会副主席。\nC 2 J 漱石，即饶漱石，\n当时任中共中央华东局第一书记、华东\n120 \nI\n \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "7a4c7c1880148d408925e9e33d371c8d052be2245215cfd7c9362641e2253f4b", "text_chars": 396}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 150, "text": "军政委员会主席。\nC 3 ] 四月二十五日电，指邓子恢一九五0年四月二十五日关于\n起草土改条例的意见给毛泽东的电报。参见本册第118 页注C 2 ] 。\nC 4 J 华中，指中共中央华中局，这是习惯称谓。一九四九年底\n华中局巳改称中南局。\n1 2 1  \n►\n \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "756cb980d64b850fc590ab8bffbff104c683279f11f6f732ade524ac07bf71ca", "text_chars": 132}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 151, "text": "给词泄瑛的信\n（一九五0 年五月二日）\n世瑛( 1 ] 学兄：\n四月二十四日来信收到，情意殷厚，极为感谢。生活困\n难，极表同情。弟千兄之情况不甚明了，不知如何可以为助。\n倘千土改时能于兄有所裨益，或于乡里故交获得援手，则似以\n就近解决为上策，未知以为然否？敬复。顺颂\n教祺！\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月二日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 ] 世瑛，即谭世瑛，毛泽东在湖南湘乡县立东山高等小学堂\n读书时的同学，毛泽东的国文教师谭咏春的儿子。\n1 22 \n4\n \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "67c0c35c4ac549bbb5db31849e5e00dc27be90cdf6863ee4966c82a80c8fd0c9", "text_chars": 231}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 152, "text": "在中央转发的华东局关千镇压\n反革命暴动及处埋群众性骚动事件\n的指示中加写的话(l)\n（一九五0 年五月五日）\n绝对不可向群众开枪。\n根据毛泽东手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 ] 这句话加括号写在中共中央华东局指示的第二项中的一段\n话之后。这段话是：“对因灾荒严重，或因秋征负担过重，群众生活\n困难，致为反革命坏分子乘机煽惑，\n因而引起群众性的但非武装的\n抢粮骚动，我在场武装部队应首先竭力加以劝阻，使他们了解抢粮\n为违法而停止抢粮。如劝阻无效，则可对空中鸣枪驱散群众\n”。\n123 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "9e65951c18c3de806044cd6b388b9601e010f1bf5833cb92576a5ca175491030", "text_chars": 240}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 153, "text": "1 24 \n为全国军事情报会议\n和全国战略情报会议题词\n（一九五0 年五月七日）\n知已知彼，百战百胜。\n毛\n泽\n东\n根据手稿刊印。\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "1b3b0fa934fccf3a1e525a1de47847f9b10ddcbc53a2981e977b7fc6418184f5", "text_chars": 66}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 154, "text": "关千同意李富春一个月后\n来北京工作的电报\n（一九五0 年五月七日）\n富春C l ] 同志：\n五月二日的信收到。\n（一）\n同意你留在东北工作半个月休\n息半个月即来京。（二）高岗[ 2 ] 同志至少要休息半个月。\n毛\n泽\n东\n五月七日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 富春，即李富春，\n当时任中共中央副秘书长、东北局副书\n记、政务院财政经济委员会副主任兼重工业部部长、东北人民政府\n副主席。\nC 2 ] 高岗，\n当时任中共中央政治局委员、东北局书记、东北人\n民政府五。\n125 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "da091b5c34b1d66496fc41700c54188203d069f8a8327d928c748ddd6d0f1de7", "text_chars": 240}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 155, "text": "给文涧泉的信\n（一九五0 年五月七日）\n涧泉( l ] 表兄大鉴：\n一月十六日来信收到，甚以为慰。唐家托现在尚有多少\n人，有饭吃否，十哥、十七哥( 2 ] 还在否，便时请你告我。文\n凯( 3 ] 先生宜在湖南就近解决工作问题，不宜远游，弟亦未便\n直接为他作介，\n尚乞谅之。运昌( 4 J 兄连来数信，\n已复一信( 5 J\n寄白蚌口，不知他接到否？南松( 6 ] 兄第二次来信已收到，感\n谢他的好意。此复，顺祝\n健康！\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月七H\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 涧泉，即文涧泉，毛泽东的表兄。\nC 2 ] 十哥，即文坢香，毛泽东的表兄。十七哥，即文枚清，毛\n泽东的表兄。\n126 \nC 3 ] 文凯，湖南湘乡白田镇白石村人，和文涧泉同宗。\nC 4 ] 运昌，即文运昌，毛泽东的表兄。\nC 5 J\n巳复一信，指毛泽东一九五0年四月十九日给文运昌的\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "6bc57a41c1ad5c76f8101e6fff58d946d81bacde7f5fd04eab6f4ee412caf1b3", "text_chars": 385}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 156, "text": "信。见i 册第84 页。\nC 亡｝南松，\n即文南松，毛泽东的表兄。\n1 27 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "9e76931d825061076d67819c21ecde6a5b9e255f0c4e54a9d438a78772c5dae2", "text_chars": 40}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 157, "text": "文先生C 1 J 左右：\n．售\n给文凯的信\n（一九五0 年五月七日）\n来信收读。先生工作问题，似宜就近设法解决。此复，敬\n颂健吉。\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月七日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 ] 指文凯，湖南湘乡白田镇白石村人，毛泽东的表兄，和文\n涧泉同宗。\n1 28 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "ea2d623701d172314b0212a473ce36fba45e7aa19f1cf54231d57f660247c188", "text_chars": 138}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 158, "text": "． \n给王汝霖的信\n（一九五0 年五月七日）\n汝霖( l )；学兄：\n一\n三十一日来信( 2 ] 收到，\n感谢你的好意。\n征粮中出了\n许多弊病，\n政府已有令( 3 ] 纠正，\n不知结果究竟如何，\n便时尚\n祈详举见告为盼！\n敬颂\n大安\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0 年五月七日\n根据手稿刊印。\n。\n9\n \n时\n言\n明\n改\n八\n革\n书\n1\n永\n名\n十\n改\n2\n的\nl\n读\n年\n县\n二\n地\n五\n月\n土\n东\n校\n，\n五\n并\n二\n区\n泽\n学\n九\n合\n年\n放\n毛\n给\n范\n师\n一\n区\n0\n解\n日\n个\n五\n新\n一\n。\n＿\n \n第\n题\n四\n九\n于\n立\n十\n问\n营\n一\n关\n省\n三\n的\n芒\n来\n«\n南\n月\n现\n白\n恩\n的\n湖\n一\n出\n、\n周\n表\n在\n年\n中\n铺\n理\n发\n东\n0\n作\n路\n总\n日\n泽\n五\n工\n大\n院\n一\n毛\n仇\n粮\n、\n务\n月\n，\n征\n江\n政\n三\n匕\n日\n才\n\\\n仗\n霖\n霖\n县\n沌\n汝\n汝\n月\n，\n才\n令\n日\n日\n、\n有\n民\n王\n王\n永\n铺\nnp\n匕\n日\n口\n巳\n人\n才\n省\n头\n府\n«\n＇\n，\n南\n桥\n湖\n的\n霖\n信\n汝\n来\n了\n县\n。\n政\n租\nI\n|?\n—\n映\n华\n县\n］，\n发\n2\n3\n \n释\nC\n孚\nC\n反\n江\n永\nC\n名\n同\n中\n同\n江\n署\n注\n的\n信\n县\n称\n日\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "1e37e3d188bae2ae8dd58eeabf56b8e7a1be6ca1cde0d47f9000b88024ce3c16", "text_chars": 533}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 159, "text": "及征收公粮的指示》。指示说：最近一次新区征粮任务很重，征粮办\n法有缺点，发生了不少严重问题，必须纠正和补救。指示规定：\n中\n央人民政府所征收的公粮，在新区不到农业总收入的百分之十七，\n地方人民政府附加公粮不得超过正粮的百分之十五。各地人民政府\n有加重地方公粮者，应予纠正。对地主征收额最高者不得超过其农\n业总收入的百分之六十，其有特殊情形者，亦不得超过百分之八十，\n超过者应适当减轻。如巳全部征收者，应即退还一部。指示还对地\n主没有实行减租或巳收预租者、\n巳实行二五减租者、地主完全收不\n到租或佃农完全不缴租者，如何征收公粮的问题作出规定。\n1 30 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "fb687b23a994cd1c7dbef80ba492c409135e656dc56b691ca87fe9a3fdaa3e5e", "text_chars": 277}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 160, "text": "给张鼎的信\n（一九五0 年五月七日）\n张鼎( 1 ] 先生：\n去年十月二十五日来信( 2 J '\n又毛泽覃( 3 ] 等照片，\n收到。\n感谢你的好意。入党事要在当地经过一定规章办理。\n此复，顺颂\n康吉！\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0 年五月七日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 张鼎，早年曾在毛泽东、何叔衡等主办的湖南自修大学附\n设补习譬校学习。\n张鼎在给毛泽东的信中，寄来他的\n＂履历关系片断\n＂，请\n办理＼党手续，并寄来他早年同毛泽覃等共青团支部成｝\n照片\nC 3 J 毛泽覃，毛泽东的二弟。一九二三年十月加入中国共产\n党。\n曾任永（丰）吉（安）泰（和）\n中心特委书记、\n中共苏区中央\n局秘书长、中央苏区独立师师长。一九三五年四月在江西瑞金作战\n时牺牲。\n131 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "6202d1d08b7b9a80c2f0b6f2ba3744639f57fd40ab309b03b6dd63390b375a88", "text_chars": 333}
